cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."

title: "DQC Emulator Benchmarking"
abstract: >-
  A benchmarking framework for distributed quantum computing emulators, using a
  distributed implementation of the inverse quantum Fourier transform as the
  test case. Evaluates execution time, memory usage, and fidelity relative to a
  monolithic baseline across SquidASM, Qiskit Aer, Interlin-q, and SQUANCH.

type: software
version: 1.1.0
